# This logo is displayed above the spinner if:
# 1. you boot via BIOS / CSM; or
# 2. you boot via EFI *and*
#    your EFI firmware has no logo
#    (see /sys/firmware/acpi/tables/BGRT)
#
# Does this work even if it is an SVG not a PNG?
